  {
    "screen": "vault-tool-dual-password-04",
    "orientation": "h",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "chapter_title",
        "text_ref": "从哪里开始",
        "align": "left",
        "size": "medium"
      },
      {
        "type": "prose",
        "text_ref": "双密码要在一份已有的库上设置：在本机终端运行 vault-tool，用菜单或 `decoy` 命令，先用原库当前密码打开它，再指定本人准备好的诱饵材料目录（decoy_source/）。AI 技能没有双密码模式，AI 可以帮我准备步骤；两套凭据都由本人在本地输入。这不是在空目录上一键新建双层库。",
        "row": "start",
        "width": "40%"
      },
      {
        "type": "source_text_card",
        "text_ref": "需要准备什么",
        "row": "start",
        "icon_position": "header_left",
        "header_icon": "_library/hires-icons/icon-clean-0432a3e02a060c22b01c.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "section_heading",
        "text_ref": "从开始到拿到结果",
        "row": "start",
        "width": "60%",
        "heading_icon": "_library/icons/scene-r3-exact-three-stairs.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "numbered_steps",
        "text_ref": "1. **确认两套内容**　分清每个密码预期打开什么，并检查原库和可用容量；装不下就停止。",
        "row": "start",
        "columns": 1,
        "icons": "none",
        "illustration": "none",
        "connector": "none"
      }
    ]
  },
